ur=200&s=b916c766edaaa35142048f1f58cadd67 3x"}, "body": "Good day\nI would like artwork of a vtuber i follow\n\n\nHer name is KaboChaKai\n\n\nNote: she has had a redesign.\nshe has a more chub/fatter in her belly:\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1HSCdIHf3qsVstomaa2jWw9m-IcSY2ljX/view?usp=drive_link\n\nCHARACTER DETAILS\n- Is a Ratgirl\n- has a band aid on her left cheek\n- chest size is C cup \n- Is around 5'5 Foot tall (65 Inches)\n- has a large metal lab rat eartag. Has the text \"KA80\" on it\n- personality is loud and mischievous.\n\n\nplease feel free to draw whatever pose and face you would like!\n\nOutfit request:\nThe default outfit of Korone Inugami from Hololive gamers:\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1aFmtxq21rmMCPmAul50MhpsRySRudN38/view?usp=sharing\n\nThis may be shown on there X page and may be used on streams to show fanart\n\nThank you\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1oY8qnkiFzKMGGu9Z1782fVSleeivHYio?usp=sharing", "nc": 16, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@tg3e94/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 3803683, "client_id": 1975927, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/376d67bc/uploads/origins/d7403d4e-3d52-4a9f-81a2-9de29dad0f11?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a1dd587eaec065a96265444f03e5201f", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/376d67bc/uploads/origins/d7403d4e-3d52-4a9f-81a2-9de29dad0f11?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a1dd587eaec065a96265444f03e5201f, https://si.imgix.net/376d67bc/uploads/origins/d7403d4e-3d52-4a9f-81a2-9de29dad0f11?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=e286a61324b4a075e0ac1435056ca918 2x, https://si.imgix.net/376d67bc/uploads/origins/d7403d4e-3d52-4a9f-81a2-9de29dad0f11?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=